cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the article and this software/dataset release."
title: "LoRaScope: open hardware, firmware and datasets for joint LoRaWAN coverage mapping and GNSS positioning-quality assessment"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Firmware, payload decoder, 3D-printable parts, field-campaign datasets and figure scripts
  accompanying the LoRaScope article. LoRaScope is a portable, modular instrument that transmits
  the GNSS solution, positioning-quality indicators and device orientation in every LoRaWAN uplink.
keywords:
  - LoRaWAN
  - GNSS
  - open hardware
  - coverage mapping
  - positioning quality
  - field measurement
